<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<div class="container my-5">
  <div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-lg-9 col-md-11">
      <div class="card shadow-sm border-0 p-4 p-md-5 rounded-4">
        <h1 class="fw-bold mb-4 text-center">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-muted text-center mb-4">Last updated: September 2026</p>
        <hr class="mb-4" />

        <div class="privacy-content">
          <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-3 mb-2">1. Information We Collect</h4>
          <p>
            When you register or use Wonderlust, we collect information you provide directly to us, such as your username, email address, profile picture (if authenticated via Google), and any listings or reviews you create on our platform.
          </p>

          <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-4 mb-2">2. How We Use Your Information</h4>
          <p>
            We use the information we collect to provide, maintain, and improve our services, including to:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Enable you to create, edit, and explore travel listings.</li>
            <li>Allow you to post reviews and ratings on destination properties.</li>
            <li>Display interactive maps using MapTiler geocoding services.</li>
            <li>Maintain account security and verify user authentication.</li>
          </ul>

          <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-4 mb-2">3. Storage & Third-Party Services</h4>
          <p>
            Your images are stored securely on Cloudinary, and your session details and account data are encrypted in MongoDB Atlas. We do not sell or rent your personal information to third parties.
          </p>

          <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-4 mb-2">4. Your Rights & Choices</h4>
          <p>
            You have the right to modify your listings, delete your reviews, and request account removal at any time by contacting our support team.
          </p>

          <h4 class="fw-semibold mt-4 mb-2">5. Contact Us</h4>
          <p class="mb-0">
            If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy, feel free to reach out to us at <a href="mailto:support@wonderlust.com" class="text-danger text-decoration-none">support@wonderlust.com</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>